士以牧尊戚〖3〗，颇推令谏争。而夫人宠渐衰，皓滋不悦〖4〗；皓母何，恒左右之〖5〗。","section_title":"妃嫔传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0107.xhtml","index":148,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":38,"end":82},{"id":"feipin-q-32f0646bec0e44cfbb26","section":"chapter-050","block":"b-25da2fcab1d5837d352b","layer":"original","quote":"父遂，本骑士。","section_title":"妃嫔传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0107.xhtml","index":137,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":12,"end":19},{"id":"feipin-q-345baa007eb6fa3206b0","section":"chapter-050","block":"b-25da2fcab1d5837d352b","layer":"original","quote":"孙和何姬，丹杨句容人也。父遂，本骑士。孙权尝游幸诸营，而姬观于道中。权望见，异之，命宦者召入，以赐子和。生男，权喜，名之曰彭祖，即皓也。","section_title":"妃嫔传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0107.xhtml","index":137,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":68},{"id":"feipin-q-7093c15e2c234ed7ac2d","section":"chapter-050","block":"b-25da2fcab1d5837d352b","layer":"original","quote":"孙和何姬，丹杨句容人也。","section_title":"妃嫔传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0107.xhtml","index":137,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":12},{"id":"feipin-q-960346bedba084080387","section":"chapter-050","block":"b-f8fad0f4016d04bd1d63","layer":"original","quote":"何姬曰：“若皆从死，谁当养孤？”遂抚育皓，及其三弟。","section_title":"妃嫔传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0107.xhtml","index":138,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":63,"end":89},{"id":"feipin-q-cfe2f7d48c16fbafb1af","section":"chapter-050","block":"b-e86ebfc6806691c4527a","layer":"original","quote":"皓即位，尊和为昭献皇帝；﹝一﹞何姬为昭献皇后，称“升平宫”。月余，进为皇太后。","section_title":"妃嫔传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0107.xhtml","index":139,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":39},{"id":"santizhu-q-8706ac1620d8269a8137","section":"chapter-048","block":"b-e798b0310c16e3738a9e","layer":"original","quote":"尊母何为太后","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":309,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":72,"end":78}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
